                    Department of State.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d154-f2" n="2" xml:id="d154-f2-content">
                <p>The source text did not indicate the time of transmission from the Embassy in
                    Korea; the telegram was received at the Department of State at 12:50 p.m., May
                    31.</p>
            </note>
